# P0-36 — live demo: select and resize, photo, edges behind: evidence

- Date: 2026-10-28 (Europe/Zurich) · worktree `../Project air-P0-36` (branch `task/P0-36`, slot 2, web port 4200); assets `?v=P0-36`.
- Method: out-of-repo CDP helper, Chrome for Testing 156 headless, real `Input.dispatchMouseEvent` / `Input.dispatchKeyEvent`. Sizes are screen px at 1440×900, zoom 1 unless noted.

```
edge z-index 1 below zone z-index 2; photo bar present: false
