```

Reading: the edge (z-index 1) lies below the zone frame (2) and the photo has no bar; a click selects the notepad and shows the chrome; its east handle +80 widens it to 320 px and the zone grows to the right keeping its corner; the table cannot get lower than its content and widens to 456 px; the free photo grows to 360 px wide and stops at the canvas bottom (142 px high); docked again it takes the notepad width (320) with its aspect ratio (126 high); a click on the empty canvas and Esc clear the selection; at 120 % zoom the handles stay 8 screen px; no horizontal overflow at 390 px. A first run showed the zone shifting 40 px left on a member resize (centre kept) and a stale raised table covering the selected photo; both were fixed before this run.

Screenshots: `P0-36-docked-resize.png`, `P0-36-free-photo.png`, `P0-36-photo-adopted.png`, `P0-36-zoom-selection.png` (1440×900).
